{"id":"arrie_re","lemma":"arrière","pos":"adv","rank":611,"glosses":["far, far away","late","rear, behind, hinter-"],"ipa":"/a.ʁjɛʁ/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/2/2d/Fr-arri%C3%A8re.ogg/Fr-arri%C3%A8re.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Mets la voiture en marche arrière.","en":"Put the car in reverse.","words":[{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"car"},null,null,null],"phrases":[[3,5,"up"]]},{"text":"Nous ne pouvons revenir en arrière.","en":"We can't go back.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to come back"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"On ne reviendra pas en arrière.","en":"We're not going back.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to come back","l":"revenir"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Je veux retourner en arrière.","en":"I want to go back.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"to turn over"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Monte dans le siège arrière.","en":"Get in the back seat.","words":[{"g":"to go up, to climb","l":"monter"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"seat, chair"},null]}]}